# {{NAME}} (Animica NFT)

ERC-721-like NFT template for Animica deterministic Python VM.

## Key methods
- `mint(to, token_id, token_uri="")`
- `transfer(frm, to, token_id, sender)`
- `approve(to, token_id, sender)`
- `burn(token_id, sender)`
- `tokenURI(token_id)`

## Usage
- Open `contract.py` and `manifest.json` in Studio IDE.
- Compile/simulate/deploy using Studio Compile/Simulate/Deploy panels or the animica CLI.
- Call methods from Studio simulate or contract call tooling.
